go-to: y32_president.result

Our offer is published in all the papers. The SPD's executive refuses within a day, since it has decided already to back Hindenburg. But the offer was read by many SPD workers, who were told by their own paper that the Communists were not interested in unity, and discovered that the Communists were.

@result
title: The vote
